<title>CANADA: Methanex abandons Trinidad purchase efforts.</title>
<headline>Methanex abandons Trinidad purchase efforts.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Methanex Corp said on Thursday it was abandoning its efforts to buy 69 percent of Trinidad Tobago Methanol Co held by the government of the Republic of Trinidad and Tobago.</p>
<p>Methanex has been advised that a minority shareholder is exercising a right of first refusal allowed under their partnership agreement to acquire the interest in TTMC.</p>
<p>A conference call is set for April 3 at 1100 EST/1600 GMT (0800 PST) to discuss Trinidad.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
